 p><span style="color: #000000\;">You will have the opportunity in upcoming
  lessons to study many talks and messages taught by President Oaks. In thi
 s unit\, you have learned more about his calling and his biography. Now we
  will consider this question together: <em>In what ways is his life a serm
 on?</em> Follow the prompts below to share lessons you learned from his li
