 ost 1\, </strong>due by Tuesday: Write <span style="text-decoration: under
 line\;">two</span> solid paragraphs (4–6 sentences each)\n<ul>\n<li><spa
 n style="color: #000000\;">Each paragraph should very briefly mention one 
