  to repeat its details)\,</span></li>\n<li><span style="color: #000000\;">
 Then explain what principles you learned\, and </span></li>\n<li><span sty
 le="color: #000000\;">Comment on how <em>you</em> can apply that example i
 n your own life and circumstances.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span st
 yle="color: #000000\;"><strong>Post 2\, </strong>due by Wednesday: After r
 eading 5+ of your peers' posts\, make a separate\, one-paragraph <em>Summa
 ry + Response</em> post. What themes and additional ideas stood out to you
