 \;">\n<li><span>Comment briefly on what you learned from Elder Bednar and 
 from your classmates’ comments above about how revealed changes in polic
 y and practice in the Church can help or have helped with <strong>“gathe
 ring [you\, your family\, and others] . . . in Christ.”</strong>&nbsp\; 
 (3-4 sentences)</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>Since full particip
